$ah_code_examples — load Anthill example scripts as grouped JSON

SUMMARY
  Scans a directory for example_<usecase>_<n>.ah files and returns one JSON document
  in texts[], grouped by use case, capped at per_usecase examples each (max 20).

SYNTAX
  $ah_code_examples(folder='test_data/examples')
  $ah_code_examples(folder='examples', per_usecase=10)

INPUT
  prompts, images, sounds, videos, files — unchanged (copied through)

OUTPUT
  texts[] — single link containing JSON:
    folder, per_usecase, usecases{ <name>: [{ file, request, script }, ...] }

ARGUMENTS
  folder= or positional path — directory to scan (non-recursive).
  per_usecase= — max examples per use case (default 20, hard cap 20).

BEHAVIOR
  Filenames must match example_<usecase>_<number>.ah.
  Optional first-line hint: # Request: <user prompt text>
  Sorted by numeric suffix within each use case.

EXAMPLE
  @refs: $ah_code_examples(folder='test_data/examples', per_usecase=20)
  @gen: @refs -> $code
  Write a script that …

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No.
